# [T2TRG](../wg/t2trg.html)

## Summary

The Thing-to-Thing Research Group (T2TRG) held an online interim meeting to discuss data modeling, network resilience, and application deployment across the IoT computing continuum. The session featured three main presentations: an overview of CORECONF-based machine-to-machine modeling and semantic transformation to SDF/ontologies; a proposal for elevating resilience into protocol-visible trust signals for AI agents and IoT systems; and application-centric considerations for deploying microservice DAGs across the IoT computing continuum.

